; PARSE-9: a commodity symbol containing a space must be double-quoted. The
; quotes are delimiters, not part of the name, so the `P` directive's symbol
; and the posting's symbol are the same commodity.
P 2017-01-01 "green apples" $1.00

2017-01-01
    a    3 "green apples"
    b   -3 "green apples"

2017-01-02
    a    "red pears" 4
    b    "red pears" -4
